    "body": "我也遇到了同样的问题。使用当前仓库的代码，在我的开发主机上编译后启动，机器狗的姿态和前面的视频拍摄情况完全一致，无法站立起来。\n但是在机器狗的主机内，直接运行Lite_Motion， 却可以正常站立。 是两者库差异导致的吗？该如何解决？\njy_exe         2.0.153      arm64\n\nI also encountered the same problem. Using the code from the current repository, after compiling and starting on my development host, the machine dog's posture is exactly the same as in the previous video, and it cannot stand up. However, when running Lite_Motion directly on the machine dog's host, it can stand normally. Is it due to differences between the two code repositories? How can I fix it?\njy_exe         2.0.153      arm64",
